The '''eastern sand dune''' was located on the [[desert]] [[planet]] [[Serolonis]].<ref name="Faster" /> Between [[19 BBY]] and [[18 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TBBDate|204}}</ref> the [[droid]] [[racer]] [[TAY-0]] heard a rumor that the last [[Riot Racing]] sponsor who had failed to pay the gangster [[Grini Millegi]] took a "permanent pit stop" in the dune.<ref name="Faster" />

